OL,3,GNEWSADate set for inquiry into vehicle
OL,4,Arecovery worker's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquiry into the death of a man who
OL,7,Fwas killed after a vehicle recovery
OL,8,Florry tipped over on top of him is to
OL,9,Fbe held early next year.
OL,11,FRobert Garvock, 68, was operating the
OL,12,Fvehicle when he died on the B999
OL,13,FPitmedden to Potterton road in
OL,14,FAberdeenshire in 2018.
OL,16,FThe senior recovery operator, from
OL,17,FLongside, was recovering a stolen van
OL,18,Fwhich was on its side down an
OL,19,Fembankment when the lorry tipped,
OL,20,Fcausing the cab to come down on him.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
